Mits?

80
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,120
Mitsuri, where are you?

81
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,120
Mitsuri, where are you?

82
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:02,680
Even though I was still just a child, I wanted to help her in the kitchen.

83
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:07,180
