112
00:09:52,220 --> 00:09:55,280
Sure, but you could also just stay at home.

113
00:09:55,280 --> 00:10:03,760
The day my prospective marriage was called off, I decided I had to hide it all.

114
00:10:05,260 --> 00:10:06,940
So I dyed my hair black.

115
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,240
