116
00:10:11,140 --> 00:10:12,940
And I pretended to be weak.

117
00:10:14,220 --> 00:10:16,320
Everyone in my family worried about me.

118
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:23,780
Soon after, a day came where I met a man who said he wanted to marry me.

119
00:10:25,780 --> 00:10:26,920
Should I do this?

120
