126
00:10:43,060 --> 00:10:45,260
Should I pretend to be someone I'm not?

127
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,940
Isn't there something else I can do?

128
00:10:48,580 --> 00:10:51,380
Some way that I can help others while still being me?

129
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:55,800
Or does this mean that there's no place in this world for me as I am?

130
00:10:57,900 --> 00:11:00,760
Isn't there anyone out there who will love me for being me?

131
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:04,180
No, this isn't right.

132
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:05,500
It can't be.

133
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:05,600
It can't be.

134
