I don't care if you're an upper rank or whatever!

155
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:11,080
Incredible!

156
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:12,540
She slashed through it all!

157
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:16,440
As if I'd ever lose to a jerk like you!

158
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,360
You better brace yourself!

159
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:20,060
Because I'm going all out!

160
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,480
