161
00:12:34,700 --> 00:12:38,280
It appears the gods smiled upon you when they bestowed their gifts.

162
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:39,840
Mitsuri.

163
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:43,680
Take pride in the strength you have.

164
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:52,960
All those who speak out against you merely fear your talents and envy you for what they haven't.

165
00:12:52,960 --> 00:13:01,620
Thank you so much!

166
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:10,180
Father, mother, thank you for making me strong from birth.

167
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:15,120
