It's fine.

199
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:30,480
If they get ripped, then I'll give you a new pair.

200
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:30,680
Huh?

201
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:41,520
I've often found myself thinking things like, should a girl be this strong?

202
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:45,680
Would people start saying yet again that I couldn't be human if I were?

203
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:49,480
