204
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:52,160
But I'm through with that.

205
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:54,900
Ms. Tanrochi's our only ray of hope!

206
00:14:54,900 --> 00:14:54,980
Huh?

207
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:04,240
