216
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,320
Move faster!

217
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:42,680
Get stronger!

218
00:15:43,340 --> 00:15:43,840
More!

219
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:50,340
You little brats!

220
00:15:58,340 --> 00:15:58,780
Huh?

221
00:15:58,780 --> 00:15:58,840
Huh?

222
00:15:58,840 --> 00:15:59,180
Huh?

223
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:08,640
If you want to get to my comrades, then you're going to have to get through me!

224
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:11,760
Tanjiro!

225
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:13,780
Where's the thing with the main body?

226
00:16:14,020 --> 00:16:14,720
Can you track it?

227
00:16:14,940 --> 00:16:15,460
I'll try!

228
00:16:15,460 --> 00:16:30,600
Found it!

229
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:30,800
This way!

230
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:34,920
Miss Konrochi can only hold off that child demon for so long!

231
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:37,760
We have to slash the main body before it's too late!

232
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:45,300
This young girl, she's moving even faster than before!

233
00:16:45,300 --> 00:16:46,440
I don't understand.

234
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,100
I don't understand.

235
00:16:47,100 --> 00:16:48,360
What's happening?

236
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:49,540
How was she?

237
00:16:49,540 --> 00:16:50,340
Oh, I don't know, it's too late!

238
00:16:50,340 --> 00:16:57,520
I don't know who's room for another class in here?

239
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:58,680
I'm so tired!

240
00:16:58,680 --> 00:16:58,720
Exactly, isn't it?

241
00:16:58,720 --> 00:16:59,220
Right now?

242
00:16:59,220 --> 00:16:59,820
I feel recursos!

243
00:16:59,820 --> 00:17:00,220
floats but water!

244
00:17:00,220 --> 00:17:00,560
I hope you're going to have to go here!

245
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:00,880
Why?

246
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:02,340
Well, it need to get through this?

247
00:17:02,340 --> 00:17:03,100
No!

248
00:17:03,100 --> 00:17:03,820
What?

249
00:17:03,820 --> 00:17:04,100
Belgian?

250
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:11,160
This is beyond annoying. Thanks to the slip of a girl, I can't unleash my dragons on those brats.

251
00:17:15,740 --> 00:17:25,240
Despicable. Nevertheless, it won't last forever. She'll run out of stamina eventually. The way all humans do.

252
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:30,980
I will protect them, no matter the cost!

253
00:17:30,980 --> 00:17:44,740
There! It's inside that tree! I'm positive. The demon is hiding inside of it! Hurry!

254
00:17:49,380 --> 00:17:53,000
Almost there! Get out of there, you bastards!

255
00:18:00,980 --> 00:18:12,980
Don't let it shake you off! Hang on! Hang on! We have to strike it down! Before that snake dragon thing starts heading this way! While Ms. Konroji's stopping it from attacking!

256
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:21,000
I can't swing my sword while holding on! But I can still do this!

257
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:31,100
Whoa! He's fighting it! His teeth are crazy strong! But won't that upset your stomach? Danya, are you gonna be okay?

258
00:18:31,100 --> 00:18:38,980
If I devour demons, it's only temporary. But I can gain demonic traits!

259
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:47,300
If I consume a strong demon, it boosts my regenerative abilities and increases my muscular strength!

260
00:18:47,300 --> 00:18:59,300
It's down! Now!

261
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:06,500
The branches are like whips! Stand your ground! Keep moving!

262
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:24,060
Nasuko's blood demon heart! Thanks to the flames, it's sluggish now! This will work! I can do this!

263
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:30,420
Kino Kamikagura! Flame dance!

264
00:19:33,740 --> 00:19:35,640
I still haven't landed a hit!

265
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:41,380
This won't end until I behead the main body!

266
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:44,240
Tadjiro! Do it!

267
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:53,060
It's gone! It must have run off again! But where?

